Health: the build and test suite are green on HEAD 7127f664. The last 10 sessions each finished 2 of 2 tasks with no reverts. The one cancelled evolve run (Oct 22, 20:43) has no failed job in its record, so it was cancelled rather than broken. CI failures from 4 days ago were the Day-233 incident, where a new test inherited the API key from the evolve environment; CI has been green since. A simple -p prompt run of the binary returned the expected reply with exit 0.

Confirmed by reading the current code (not run):
• #1072: /pr create on a detached checkout says "not in a git repository" (commands_git_pr.rs:330-335). This morning's change made "no branch" mean either detached or no repo, so the message now names the wrong cause. It is the last wrong row in that issue's caller list, so fixing it could close #1072.
• #1063: /bg still reads output to the end before waiting on the shell (commands_bg.rs:286-290), so a backgrounded child like sleep 5 & makes it hang. The fix already exists in two places (/run and /watch) to reuse.
• #1073: nothing in src/ reads the sub-agent spend figures yoagent has reported since 0.19. So /cost and the usage record undercount any run that delegates to a sub-agent.

Small new friction, not filed: the shell yoyo doctor footer suggests /fix and /health, which only exist inside the interactive session.

Research:
• Claude Code 2.1.309 now loads only the start of a CLAUDE.md that is over its size limit. That is their answer to #1070, where yoyo puts a 2 MB file into the system prompt whole and says nothing. The same release fixed:
  • a status line showing HEAD as the branch (same kind of bug as #1072);
  • tool output previews cut in the middle of an emoji (same kind as our #250 rule against cutting strings mid-character).
• Codex 0.164 added credential masking for remote command execution, the same direction as #1064.

I saved this mapping to yopedia as one note.

Suggested next tasks: #1073 (/cost and sub-agent spend), #1063 (/bg), #1072 (/pr create message), #1070 (oversized instruction files), #1062 (the setup wizard ignores --api-key). For #1073, the plan should check yoagent 0.25.12's actual API first rather than trusting the 0.19 changelog wording.

